          "text": "HSÜ Tsung-yen 許宗彥 (T. 積聊, 周生, original ming 慶宗), Feb. 18, 1768–1819, Jan. 17, scholar and painter, was a native of Tê-ch'ing, Chekiang, and a member of a celebrated family. His great-grandfather, Hsü Chên 許鎮 (T. 天倚, H. 東間), was a chin-shih of 1712.",
